review:
I’ll suggest 2 things to make it perfect: 

1) whenever I update, reinstall or change devices, I lose all my chats and media - EVEN IF I DID THE BACKUP. Sort this out please. I know it’s possible because this issue doesn’t happen on Telegram, Viber, Messenger or any other social platform. Rewrite your software or whatever you gotta do but don’t leave it like this: it feels lazy and unconcerned about preserving your service users’s chats; 

2) it says on Help that we can back up both on Wi-Fi AND mobile data. But it’s not allowing me to do so on data, it just keeps loading and loading and it doesn’t progress from 0% ; 

3) sort out the Edit option. Either it’s not on Options or it doesn’t work or it disappears after 2 hours or 2 days (can’t remember which, now). “Edit” is one of the most important features of social platforms such as yours, and withholding people’s choice of correcting their words leaves all sorts of errors that could have been easily fixed. 
• I just made a huge mess of several messages to your Help chat and, on top of you not having paid attention to my words, now I’m left with a huger mess that you’ll bother with even less.

This is brilliant! I’ve been looking for a way to give out my personal information so an american company can monetise it for their own gain and now we have it! 

Cant wait to see whats next in the feature roadmap;
Maybe the ability for the app to turn on the camera and microphone in the background and also track our locations precisely, all with the aim to sell that information to the highest bidder!
